Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.84,0:00:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}所有字体变来变去，仍是旧文一篇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.14,0:00:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}这些草稿没一个说得通
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.54,0:00:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}没有歌舞，没有终局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(460,460)}不过一时风潮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.26,0:00:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}每次尝试都是徒劳一击
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.92,0:00:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}摔得越重，越是糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.68,0:00:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}“该登场了！”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.68,0:00:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}聚光灯亮起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.38,0:00:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}这些你早已做过
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.11,0:00:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}再多跑一步
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.77,0:00:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}这条路是你选的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.39,0:00:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(256,256)}所以他
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.16,0:00:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}修补，修补，修补
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.69,0:00:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(268,268)}碎掉的玻璃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.50,0:00:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}碎片仍粘在他背上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.85,0:00:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}每一小片反光都是他们缺失的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.38,0:01:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}如今已越来越难数清
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.10,0:01:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(310,310)}时钟在
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.04,0:01:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(483,483)}滴答，滴答，滴答
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.48,0:01:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(266,266)}来不及问
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.28,0:01:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}潮汐何时会退去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.43,0:01:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(406,406)}于是，她手指拂过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.64,0:01:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}掩去所有污迹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.19,0:01:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(406,406)}他们列队走过舞台
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.40,0:01:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(393,393)}面具之下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.58,0:01:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(484,484)}再次唱起副歌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.04,0:01:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}再次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.18,0:01:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(410,410)}而在一次绝望的尝试中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.41,0:01:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(447,447)}想找到一个能理解
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.75,0:01:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(456,456)}他字里行间空隙的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.12,0:01:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}墨汁已泼满全身
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.82,0:01:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}那是一团词不达意的混乱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.28,0:02:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}可惜的是，它甚至没
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.00,0:02:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(368,368)}沾到笔尖
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.10,0:02:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(372,372)}“可那不是羽毛笔，”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.22,0:02:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(417,417)}人人都这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.47,0:02:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(419,419)}但他还是咬住笔管
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.73,0:02:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(188,188)}就像她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.30,0:02:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(341,341)}咬住自己的舌头
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.32,0:02:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(421,421)}于是，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.58,0:02:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}也就不足为奇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.19,0:02:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}他们最终变成这样，也正因如此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.71,0:02:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(263,263)}没有用
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.50,0:02:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(490,490)}修补，修补，修补
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.97,0:02:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(230,230)}破掉的玻璃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.66,0:02:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}如果碎片不断卷土重来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.11,0:02:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}每段旋律都是当作事实的戏谑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.63,0:02:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}来自剧作家无法收回的手稿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.32,0:02:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(306,306)}而心仍在
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.24,0:02:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}跳动，跳动，跳动
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.77,0:02:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(291,291)}不顾裂痕
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.64,0:02:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}镜子开口问道：
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.82,0:02:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(402,402)}“你为何要对待
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.03,0:02:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(494,494)}背上的伤痕
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.52,0:02:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}明知它们将永远亲吻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.52,0:02:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(264,264)}轨迹？”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.31,0:02:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(230,230)}接缝在
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.00,0:02:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}撕裂，撕裂，撕裂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.60,0:02:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(268,268)}再次裂成两半
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.40,0:02:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}但不必假装
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.54,0:02:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(395,395)}剧本也许有瑕疵
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.73,0:02:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}但即便如此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.26,0:02:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}你仍配得上这支笔的创作者
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.02,0:02:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(263,263)}而时间老人仍在
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.81,0:02:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}滴答，滴答，滴答
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.38,0:02:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(268,268)}没有尽头
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.19,0:02:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}他在他们床边跪下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.33,0:02:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}“我亲爱的孩子，这一生，你可曾后悔？”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.95,0:02:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}他们对他微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.54,0:02:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(295,295)}摇了摇头
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.43,0:03:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(494,494)}说他们愿意重来一次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.91,0:03:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}重来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.17,0:03:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}我愿意全部重来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.53,0:03:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}我愿意全部重——
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.84,0:03:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}——来……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.55,0:03:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,5000)}{\pos(1467,766)}谢谢。\N[……因为明天，太阳依旧会升起；\N谁又知道潮水会带来什么呢？]\N——《荒岛余生》（2000年）
